Notice for the files copied into this directory

assets/plausible/clickhouse/logs.xml
assets/plausible/clickhouse/ipv4-only.xml
assets/plausible/clickhouse/low-resources.xml
assets/plausible/clickhouse/default-profile-low-resources-overrides.xml

These four ClickHouse configuration files are copied unchanged from the repository
https://github.com/plausible/community-edition at its v3.2.1 tag (directory clickhouse/).
That repository is licensed under the MIT License, whose text follows. Noust ships them
as the project does, so that the ClickHouse of the Plausible Community Edition recipe uses
less memory, binds to IPv4 and keeps a short query log.

